Type: Package
Package: nflendzoneModel
Title: NFL Bayesian Modeling with Pre-compiled Stan Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Tyler", "Pollard", , "tylerpollard410@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: NFL Bayesian state-space models for team strength estimation
    and game prediction. Includes pre-compiled CmdStan models for
    efficient fitting and forecasting with helper functions for data
    preparation and sequential backtesting.
